<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Australian resource basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Australian resource basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million American-style call warrants, on the SBC resource basket Australia, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein said.</p>
<p>The basket comprises of four Australian listed stocks each with a diverse exposure to metals and other resources. It includes shares of Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd, IM Holdings Ltd, Pasminco Ltd and Western Mining Corp Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    A$45.00		   PREMIUM	15.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.68 DEM		  GEARING	7.6 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.FEB.97-24.JUN.98   PAYDATE	06.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  A$44.09</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
